      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "26cdac2ac2a269cc8eb40de6b365c682b4b59229527efc5f2441ee519c756b1f",
      "text": "Buffet breakfast. Transfer to the airport for your flight to Lima. We’ll meet you at the airport on arrival and take you to Ikonik 4★ or a comparable hotel. The rest of the day is free.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-0dd0eb81fb73",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:e450bb5e43b524b7",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8e64812b9d9011147077651a14322433292777e1c021162e666315797b34241c",
      "text": "You can add a 2-day, 1-night trip to Paracas and the Nazca Lines. A tourist coach takes you from Lima to Paracas, where you’ll spend the night at a hotel on the Pacific coast.\n\nA flight over the Nazca Lines is available as an extra. From the air, you can see huge figures of animals and birds and geometric shapes traced across the desert. We quote this two-day trip separately and coordinate it with your arrival from La Paz.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-0dd0eb81fb73",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      }
    },
    {
